        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DS-SQAx325 3-1/4\" Square Acrylic Door Stops</b>\r\n<p>\r\nNew very contemporary design acrylic baseboard door stop from the <a href=\"/collections/acrylic-collection\"><b>First Impressions Acrylic Collection</b></a>. They are available in <b>Crystal Clear or Frosted Acrylic</b>. Easy to install with included mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPictured below is a clear acrylic door stop on a bath room door. These door stops are <b>So Clear They Disappear</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/clear-acrylic-door-stop.jpg?v=1704442272\" width=\"446\" height=\"350\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions clear acrylic door stop\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese 3-1/4 inch standard length acrylic door stops screw onto the baseboard casement, door bottom or wall anchor, to protect not just the wall and door, but your door knob or lever as well. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions DS-SQAx325 Square Acrylic Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/4\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Material: Extruded Acrylic</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>Special Edition. Limited Quantities Available. Order Now.</b>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>Sold Out.</b> See available <a href=\"/collections/stops-bumpers\"><b>Door Stops</a></b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
