                "title": "3-1/4 Inch Square Acrylic Door Stop, First Impressions DS-SQAx325",
                "description": "First Impressions Square Clear Acrylic Door Stops. New very contemporary design acrylic baseboard door stop. They are available in Crystal Clear or Frosted Acrylic. Easy to install with included mounting hardware. These standard length acrylic door stops screw onto the baseboard casement, door bottom or wall anchor, to protect not just the wall and door, but your door knob or lever as well. These door stops are So Clear They Disappear!",
